Package: libcrypto-awslc1
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Multi-Arch: same
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends},
Description: AWS-LC general-purpose cryptographic library
 AWS-LC is a general-purpose cryptographic library maintained by the AWS
 Cryptography team, based on code from the Google BoringSSL project and the
 OpenSSL project. It offers the OpenSSL 1.1.1 API.
 .
 This package contains libcrypto-awslc. Its library name, its SONAME and its
 versioned symbols (AWS_LC_1.0) are distinct from OpenSSL's, so it installs
 and loads beside the system OpenSSL.

Package: libssl-awslc1
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Multi-Arch: same
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends},
Description: AWS-LC TLS library
 AWS-LC is a general-purpose cryptographic library maintained by the AWS
 Cryptography team, based on code from the Google BoringSSL project and the
 OpenSSL project. It offers the OpenSSL 1.1.1 API.
 .
 This package contains libssl-awslc, the TLS library. Its library name, its
 SONAME and its versioned symbols (AWS_LC_1.0) are distinct from OpenSSL's,
 so it installs and loads beside the system OpenSSL.

Package: libaws-lc-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Multi-Arch: same
Depends:
 libcrypto-awslc1 (= ${binary:Version}),
 libssl-awslc1 (= ${binary:Version}),
 ${misc:Depends},
Description: AWS-LC development files
 AWS-LC is a general-purpose cryptographic library maintained by the AWS
 Cryptography team, based on code from the Google BoringSSL project and the
 OpenSSL project. It offers the OpenSSL 1.1.1 API.
 .
 This package contains the headers in /usr/include/aws-lc, the linker
 symlinks, the pkg-config files (aws-lc, libcrypto-awslc, libssl-awslc) and
 the CMake package files (crypto, ssl). Compile with
 "pkg-config --cflags --libs aws-lc": <openssl/...> then resolves to the
 AWS-LC headers.

Package: aws-lc-tools
Section: utils
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends},
Description: AWS-LC command line tools
 AWS-LC is a general-purpose cryptographic library maintained by the AWS
 Cryptography team, based on code from the Google BoringSSL project and the
 OpenSSL project.
 .
 This package contains aws-lc-openssl and aws-lc-bssl, command line tools
 built against AWS-LC, and the aws-lc-c_rehash script. They are named apart
 from the OpenSSL tools.
